DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The xxhhccii driver provides support for the USB eXtensible Host Controller
     Interface, which provides an interface to usb(4) devices.

     xHCI controllers support all USB 3.0, 2.0 and 1.x device speeds.

